  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Armed Forces of the Federated Suns integrate conventional infantry directly into their Regimental Combat Teams, assigning foot, mechanized, and jump platoons to work permanently alongside BattleMech and armored formations. Towing light autocannon that provide sustained long-range direct fire, these field gun crews deliver suppressive capability that pins enemy formations at distances beyond personal weapons range.</p>"
